@{ ViewData["Title"]="Privacy"; }
<div class="narrow card prose"><h1>Privacy by design</h1><p>Entries and files are private to their owner unless an active share explicitly permits access. Administrators do not receive automatic access to private timelines.</p><h2>Files and records</h2><p>Files are stored outside the public web directory. Downloads require current permission. Entry edits retain earlier revisions; updates are append-only. Removing an entry hides it from your timeline and shares; it is a soft deletion and does not erase stored history or files.</p><h2>Sharing and exports</h2><p>Share recipients can download attachments. Exported and downloaded copies remain outside this app’s control. Link shares can be used by anyone holding the link.</p><h2>Operational data</h2><p>Security and access events record user identifiers, actions and timestamps. Passwords are hashed through ASP.NET Core Identity. Contact your deployment operator to request account deletion, retention details or backup removal. This MVP does not automate permanent deletion.</p></div>
